---
// Copy is taken verbatim from the vision statement attached to RCC-7.
---

<section id="about" class="cew-section scroll-mt-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="relative">
        <img
            src="/images/placeholds/photo-4.jpg"
            alt=""
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-80 md:h-[30rem] object-cover rounded-3xl"
        />
        <div class="hidden md:block absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 max-w-xs rounded-2xl bg-orchid text-white p-6">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-white/70 mb-2">Our Goal</p>
            <p class="text-lg leading-snug">
                To equip and encourage our women to fulfill their creation design and embrace the
                redemptive calling with excellence.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-4">
            <span class="cew-rule"></span>
            <p class="cew-eyebrow">Who We Are</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="cew-heading text-balance">A vibrant community of women</h2>

        <p class="cew-prose text-pretty">
            We exist to create a vibrant community of women who seek to deepen their relationship with God,
            embrace their God-given potential, and transform lives through acts of love, service, and discipleship.
        </p>

        <p class="cew-prose text-pretty">
            Whether you are new to the church or have been here for years, married or single, a mother or
            not yet — there is a place for you here. We gather to study the Word, to pray for one another,
            and to walk through every season together.
        </p>

        <!-- The goal card is positioned over the image on md+; repeated inline on small screens. -->
        <div class="md:hidden rounded-2xl bg-orchid text-white p-6">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-white/70 mb-2">Our Goal</p>
            <p class="text-lg leading-snug">
                To equip and encourage our women to fulfill their creation design and embrace the
                redemptive calling with excellence.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
            <a class="cew-btn-outline" href="/contact">Connect With Us</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
